title: "SZL Holdings Platform — governed AI decision infrastructure (proprietary)"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-05-28"
abstract: >-
  Monorepo for SZL Holdings' governed AI decision infrastructure, including
  the Ouroboros runtime (Λ-monotone governance substrate), the Lutar Invariant Λ
  implementation, and supporting policy/evidence packages. This repository is
  proprietary (see LICENSE). The associated thesis (Ouroboros Thesis v18 —
  Multi-track Substrate Expansion) is published separately at
  szl-holdings/ouroboros-thesis under CC-BY-4.0 and should be cited via
  that repository's CITATION.cff if you are citing the thesis text.
